wing Xi To Rule ...\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBO8HvNTvwk\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The historic vote from China's parliament paves the way for President Xi Jinping to stay in power for life, with only two dissenting votes ...\",\n      \"date\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Muddled Case Against Xi Jinping's Third Term\",\n      \"link\": \"https://blogs.lse.ac.uk/cff/2022/03/31/the-muddled-case-against-xi-jinpings-third-term/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Many commentators believe that Xi Jinping violated a cornerstone of the Party's “succession norm” by removing term limits for the PRC Chairman ...\",\n      \"date\": \"Mar 31, 2022\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"China Abolishes Presidential Term Limits To Increase Economic Stability\",\n      \"link\": \"https://fpa.org/china-abolishes-presidential-term-limits-to-increase-economic-stability/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"China's move to abolish its limit on presidential terms aims to increase economic stability, thereby increasing the government's domestic legitimacy for the ...\",\n      \"date\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Unrivaled Power: The Lifting of China's Presidential Term Limits\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.cfr.org/event/unrivaled-power-lifting-chinas-presidential-term-limits\",\n      \"snippet\": \"China's constitution to eliminate presidential term limits, allowing President Xi Jinping to remain in power indefinitely, d a 10-year limit of ...\",\n      \"date\": \"Mar 22, 2018\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"China's political system prides itself on stability. But its leader has set a new ...\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.facebook.com/TheEconomist/posts/chinas-political-system-prides-itself-on-stability-but-its-leader-has-set-a-new-/1544715347686980/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"China's authoritarian system faces a significant shift with the abolition of term limits for the presidency, potentially leading to a personal ...\",\n      \"date\